<title>USA: Quanex Corp Q1 Jan 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Quanex Corp Q1 Jan 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.31		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  4,326		    1,525</p>
<p> Revs		     194,934		  151,147</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,932		   13,595</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 earnings per share from continuing operations: $0.23 vs $0.18.  </p>
<p>1996 Q1 net includes earnings from discontinued operations of $1.1 million, or $0.08 a share.</p>
<p>1995 Q1 net includes a gain of $1.6 million or $0.12 a share from discontinued operations and a charge of $2.5 million or $0.19 a share from early extinguishment of debt.</p>
</text>
